<title>USA: Telebras six month consolidated net rises.</title>
<headline>Telebras six month consolidated net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>	   SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Consolidated Net  $1,493,800	     $1,342,900</p>
<p> Gross Revs	   9,598,200		7,902,900</p>
<p> Oper Revs	    7,316,500		6,001,638</p>
<p>(All data above 000s Reais)</p>
<p>NOTE: Consolidated net per thousand shares R$5.70 vs R$5.07.</p>
<p>Q2 Installed fixed lines for 1997 Q2 was 10.63 per 100 inhabitants  vs 10.21 per 100 inhabitants in year ago period.</p>
</text>
